{"id":"vod_md_3258","vodId":"3258","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"吹响悠风号","name_cn":"吹响悠风号","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230825-1/0ceef33932da8604b62b4a12f35c4e55.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生北宇治高中，黄前久美子（黑泽知叶 配音）刚刚踏入校园，对于未知的高中生活，久美子充满了憧憬。加藤叶月（朝井彩加 配音）是久美子的同级生，在叶月的极力劝说之下，耳根软的久美子在半推半就之下加入了学校的吹奏乐部。曾经，吹奏乐部有着十分辉煌的历史，然而，在换了顾问之后，吹奏乐部渐渐落寞，如今，音乐老师泷升（樱井孝宏 配音）作为新的顾问新鲜赴任，他对重振吹奏乐部，进军全国大会有着极大的信心。个性乐观开朗的川岛绿辉（丰田萌绘 配音）、理智冷静的高坂丽奈（安济知佳 配音）、大姐头田中明日香（寿美菜子 配音），在这些前辈们的陪伴和指导之下，久美子快乐的高中生活就此拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-25 07:40:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/WyoZeaGD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/nMkZ1dqp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/3kj2q5rT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/ri9BIHrU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/mCYfc1V7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/yS2BLJZk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/gyxI7HSv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/uQqfEa23/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/QSInpbTN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/uRNrWvas/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/AFm6di7z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/0xQNaZY9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/uZeGSE5R/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/E4NKGdwh/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:28.987Z"}